{"step_index":27,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T08:24:12Z","input_tokens":6311,"cache_read_tokens":42953,"output_tokens":305,"thinking":"Designing edge functions requires leveraging native Web Crypto primitives for HMAC-SHA256 cookie signing to ensure stateless session security. Environment secrets like the administrative password and repository tokens must rely on platform-native environment bindings rather than hardcoded configuration. Routing rules need explicit redirection declarations to properly map incoming requests to these serverless endpoints.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/p/* /viewer.html 200\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\Ust. Udin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\property-360-vr\\_redirects"}}]}
