{"step_index":47,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T08:25:18Z","input_tokens":2410,"cache_read_tokens":56228,"output_tokens":1805,"content":"Web **360° VR Property Tour** sudah selesai dibuat di folder `C:\\Users\\Ust. Udin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\property-360-vr` (Anda disarankan membuka/menjadikan folder ini sebagai **active workspace** di Antigravity).\n\n### Fitur yang Sudah Dibangun\n\n1. **Katalog & Link Khusus Per Projek ([index.html](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/index.html) & [_redirects](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/_redirects))**\n   - Menampilkan daftar semua projek properti (jumlah ruangan interior/eksterior, lokasi, harga, thumbnail) dari [projects.json](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/data/projects.json).\n   - Setiap projek punya link khusus `/p/<slug>` (contoh: `/p/cluster-anggrek`) yang langsung membuka tur 360° projek tersebut.\n\n2. **360° VR Viewer + Denah & Radar Interaktif ([viewer.html](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/viewer.html), [pano-viewer.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/js/pano-viewer.js), [viewer-app.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/js/viewer-app.js))**\n   - **Minimap Denah**: Menampilkan gambar denah dan titik lokasi setiap ruangan (`Interior` biru, `Exterior` hijau). Titik ruangan yang sedang dibuka otomatis menyala/berdenyut (emas), dan berpindah otomatis saat user pindah spot. Klik titik di denah juga bisa langsung pindah ke ruangan tersebut.\n   - **Kompas / Radar Arah Pandang**: Kerucut radar di denah berputar *real-time* mengikuti arah kamera 360°.\n   - **Mode VR Cardboard (Split-Screen) & Gyroscope HP**: Mendukung sensor gerak HP (`DeviceOrientationEvent`) serta tampilan stereo 2 layar untuk kacamata VR.\n   - **Hotspot Panah 360°**: Panah melayang di dalam foto 360° untuk berpindah antar ruangan (interior ↔ eksterior).\n\n3. **Panel Admin Berpassword + Visual Editor ([admin.html](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/admin.html) & [admin-app.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/js/admin-app.js))**\n   - Login berpassword dengan cookie sesi `HttpOnly`.\n   - Tambah/edit/hapus projek, ganti nama & slug URL, upload thumbnail, denah, dan foto 360° per ruangan.\n   - **Visual Floorplan Editor**: Klik langsung pada gambar denah untuk menaruh/memindah titik lokasi ruangan (`pinX%`, `pinY%`) dan atur *North Offset* arah radar.\n   - **Visual 360° Hotspot Editor**: Klik langsung di dalam preview 360° untuk menaruh panah pindah ruangan.\n   - Tersedia tombol **Export JSON** sebagai cadangan unduh `projects.json`.\n\n4. **Integrasi Cloudflare Pages + GitHub ([functions/api/](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/login.js))**\n   - [login.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/login.js), [logout.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/logout.js), [auth-check.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/auth-check.js) memverifikasi password dari Environment Variable Cloudflare (`ADMIN_PASSWORD`).\n   - [projects.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/projects.js) & [upload.js](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/functions/api/upload.js) langsung menyimpan `data/projects.json` dan file gambar ke repository GitHub Anda via GitHub API.\n\n---\n\n### Cara Menjalankan & Mencoba\n\n**1. Di Komputer Lokal (Sekarang):**\nJalankan server lokal bawaan ([dev_server.py](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/dev_server.py)):\n```powershell\npython dev_server.py\n```\nLalu buka di browser:\n- Katalog: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/`\n- Demo Tur 360°: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/cluster-anggrek`\n- Panel Admin: `http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin.html` (password default lokal: `admin123`)\n\n**2. Deploy ke GitHub + Cloudflare Pages:**\nPanduan lengkapnya ada di [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/README.md) (cukup *push* ke GitHub, hubungkan ke Cloudflare Pages, lalu isi Environment Variables `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SESSION_SECRET`, `GITHUB_TOKEN`, `GITHUB_OWNER`, `GITHUB_REPO`, `GITHUB_BRANCH`).\n\n*(Catatan: Aset demo 360° & denah sudah digenerate, sintaks [dev_server.py](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/dev_server.py) sudah terkompilasi, dan struktur [projects.json](file:///C:/Users/Ust.%20Udin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/property-360-vr/data/projects.json) sudah tervalidasi; pengujian koneksi HTTP lokal tidak dijalankan di sandbox karena pembatasan socket).*","thinking":"Compilation succeeded and project data loaded correctly with initial rooms. Formulating final Indonesian summary highlighting workspace directory, directory structure, and implemented features including the panoramic viewer and interactive minimap.\n\n"}
